    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Courier Bay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Courier Bay \u2013 a delivery simulator full of charm, heart, and a whole lot of cargo!</strong> <br>Step into the shoes of <strong>Leo</strong>, a new recruit at Bay Express, as you navigate a vibrant city filled with unique neighborhoods, unforgettable characters, and stories tucked between packages and delivery notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this stylized low-poly game with a cozy atmosphere, you\u2019ll face the daily grind of a delivery worker on the rise. Each day brings new routes, quirky clients, and choices that shape your journey toward becoming a partner at Bay Express\u2014if you can survive the daily hustle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore districts like <strong>Crystal Bay</strong>, with its lakeside mansions, or brave the industrial maze of <strong>Rustpoint</strong>. Uncover local dramas, urban mysteries, and unexpected friendships with residents like Seu Arlindo, the wise grocer full of sayings, and Elias Ramos, a former fisherman turned contemplative pier clerk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courier Bay is more than just delivering packages \u2014 it\u2019s about <strong>meeting people, understanding places, and growing through the ordinary.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Narrative delivery simulation</strong> with evolving daily missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9a <strong>Multiple vehicles</strong>, including trucks, vans, and jeeps, each with unique physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>A rich and varied city</strong> with over 100 buildings, including rural, industrial, and urban areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>NPCs with unique personalities</strong> and custom-crafted dialogue interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Top-down interactive map</strong> with free navigation between districts and landmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your first day on the job. The city is waiting. <br>Courier Bay \u2014 <strong>where every package has a story.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Courier Bay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Courier Bay \u2013 a delivery simulator full of charm, heart, and a whole lot of cargo!</strong> <br>Step into the shoes of <strong>Leo</strong>, a new recruit at Bay Express, as you navigate a vibrant city filled with unique neighborhoods, unforgettable characters, and stories tucked between packages and delivery notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this stylized low-poly game with a cozy atmosphere, you\u2019ll face the daily grind of a delivery worker on the rise. Each day brings new routes, quirky clients, and choices that shape your journey toward becoming a partner at Bay Express\u2014if you can survive the daily hustle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore districts like <strong>Crystal Bay</strong>, with its lakeside mansions, or brave the industrial maze of <strong>Rustpoint</strong>. Uncover local dramas, urban mysteries, and unexpected friendships with residents like Seu Arlindo, the wise grocer full of sayings, and Elias Ramos, a former fisherman turned contemplative pier clerk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courier Bay is more than just delivering packages \u2014 it\u2019s about <strong>meeting people, understanding places, and growing through the ordinary.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Narrative delivery simulation</strong> with evolving daily missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9a <strong>Multiple vehicles</strong>, including trucks, vans, and jeeps, each with unique physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>A rich and varied city</strong> with over 100 buildings, including rural, industrial, and urban areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>NPCs with unique personalities</strong> and custom-crafted dialogue interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Top-down interactive map</strong> with free navigation between districts and landmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your first day on the job. The city is waiting. <br>Courier Bay \u2014 <strong>where every package has a story.</strong></p>",
